<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank 2-wk repo average yield 14.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank 2-wk repo average yield 14.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Friday  that average, maximum and minimum yield in a two-week reverse repo  operation to drain liquidity was 14.7 percent at which all bids were  accepted.</p>
<p>In a similar operation on Wednesday, average yield was 14.89 perecnt.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
